  "question": {
    "text": "The value of aluminium susceptibility is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The percentage increase in the magnetic field if space within a current carrying toroid is filled with aluminium is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></math>. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "22",
